#
# fivestar-loader --input-script: answers the first-run screens of an empty save folder unattended, up to the story
# load (docs/running.md#first-run-in-the-game). Times are seconds from loader start. With a warm pipeline cache the
# black "press a button" screen showed 45 to 220 s in. Presses are held 0.3 s: while pipelines compile the game runs
# at 10 to 20 frames a second and missed 0.2 s presses, and from about 0.5 s a held arrow repeats.
#
# A tap passes the black screen, skips the logos and confirms each option screen (minimap, text size, the Off
# option, brightness, controls notice); on the legal screen it does nothing while the Legal item has the focus.
40 Space hold 0.3 repeat 91 every 4
# Legal and photosensitivity: focus down twice (the photosensitivity item keeps the focus about 15 s), then Next.
410 Down hold 0.3
430 Down hold 0.3
450 Space hold 0.3
# Privacy policy and terms of service: each item is a check box that A toggles (its text need not be scrolled), so
# one press each; then Confirm starts the story load. The screen drops its first press (a Space at 470 s and at 480 s
# both left the privacy box unchecked), so an Up, which does nothing on the top item, goes first. If a box stays
# unchecked, presses appended to the script while it runs can still fix it.
480 Up hold 0.3
486 Space hold 0.3
492 Down hold 0.3
498 Space hold 0.3
504 Down hold 0.3
510 Space hold 0.3
